            "description": "DNS records that should be configured for the domain. The provider diffs this list against existing custom records \u2014 only removed records are deleted and new or changed records are upserted. Records in other DNS groups (product, personalNS) are not affected.",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          }
